        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é código assíncrono?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Código que executa enquanto o jogo continua rodando</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Código que executa apenas em uma ordem estrita de cima para baixo sem esperar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Código que executa uma linha de cada vez e nunca pode pausar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Código que executa enquanto o jogo continua rodando.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que melhor descreve o código a seguir?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting game setup&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score += \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game setup is complete&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Our current score is \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;This log prints last&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O código é síncrono</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O código é assíncrono</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há código suficiente para chegar a uma conclusão</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O código é síncrono.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é uma função de callback?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uma função que passamos para outra função e chamamos mais tarde (por exemplo, depois que um inimigo aparece)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uma função especial que pode ser usada apenas uma vez em um jogo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Uma função que só é executada por si mesma e nunca pode ser passada adiante</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Uma função que passamos para outra função e chamamos mais tarde (por exemplo, depois que um inimigo aparece).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Passe a função de callback para o método assíncrono <code>setTimeout</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"setTimeout\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"130\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"callbackFunc\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawned an enemy later because we're using asynchronous code.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(callbackFunc, \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame 1: game loop continues&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame 2: player can still move&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>callbackFunc</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invoque a função de callback dentro de <code>sayHello</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"103\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showLevelIntro = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"levelName, callback\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Entering: \" /><text value=\"${levelName}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  callback();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" startLevel = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showLevelIntro(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", startLevel);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>callback()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que o método <code>setTimeout()</code> faz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Executa um callback uma vez após um atraso (como gerar um power-up após 2 segundos)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele executa seu callback repetidamente em um intervalo fixo</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ele cria um temporizador de atraso que cancela outro método automaticamente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Executa um callback uma vez após um atraso (como gerar um power-up após 2 segundos).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149829,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que o método <code>clearInterval()</code> faz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele para um callback repetido iniciado por <code>setInterval()</code> (como parar um cronômetro em contagem)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele sempre aceita 3 parâmetros</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Funciona apenas se o callback do intervalo retornar true</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele para um callback repetido iniciado por <code>setInterval()</code> (como parar um cronômetro em contagem).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece no código a seguir?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" callback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy AI tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(callback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy AI ticks were stopped&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O callback é executado a cada 200 milissegundos até que <code>clearInterval()</code> o pare</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O callback é executado uma vez após um atraso de 200 milissegundos</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O callback é executado a cada 1000 milissegundos até que <code>clearInterval()</code> o pare</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O callback é executado a cada 200 milissegundos até que <code>clearInterval()</code> o pare.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149831,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invoque <code>setTimeout()</code> com a função de callback e um atraso de <code>1000</code> milissegundos.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"callback\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ourCallback\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game is running...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>setTimeout</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>ourCallback,</code>, <code>1000</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149832,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invoque o método <code>setInterval()</code> com a função de callback e um atraso de <code>200</code> milissegundos. Salve-o na variável <code>intervalID</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"settimeout\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"intervalID\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ourCallback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ticks stopped after 1.2 seconds.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>setInterval</code> seguido de <code>ourCallback</code> e finalmente <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
