            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a condição <code>if</code> para garantir que a promessa seja resolvida.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"reject\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"boss\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"288\" endIndex=\"304\" /><option startIndex=\"304\" endIndex=\"312\" /><option startIndex=\"323\" endIndex=\"330\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelData = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"forest\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;speed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"desert\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ammo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;map&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"boss\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"loadForestLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Promise\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"resolve, reject\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (levelData.forest.enemies &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   resolve(\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest level loaded with enemies. Starting level.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" startLoad = loadForestLevel();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(startLoad);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>levelData.forest</code> seguido de <code>.enemies</code> e finalmente <code>resolve</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
